34
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>there was something beyond that, what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

35
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>nani wo mitsumete iru darou</b></font></font></font></font>

36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:31,190 --> 00:01:33,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm, what?</font>

38
00:01:35,570 --> 00:01:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wanted flyer.</font>

39
00:01:38,570 --> 00:01:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"This man who calls himself Tokichi
is a major criminal</font>

40
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:44,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who has killed a family of three"</font>

41
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"He has a bird-shaped birthmark
on his chest"</font>

42
00:01:48,710 --> 00:01:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bird-shaped birthmark?
It couldn't be.</font>

43
00:01:52,380 --> 00:01:54,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Hinata?</font>

44
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't tell because
his face is covered with scars.</font>

45
00:01:57,760 --> 00:02:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he has... a bird-shaped birthmark.</font>

46
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has... a bounty on his head, too?</font>

47
00:02:06,810 --> 00:02:10,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck is going on
with everything?</font>

48
00:02:16,490 --> 00:02:20,950
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Catch or be Caught?!</font></font>

49
00:02:16,490 --> 00:02:20,950
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Showdown at</font></font>

50
00:02:16,490 --> 00:02:20,950
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">the OK Temple</font></font>

51
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you going, old man?</font>

52
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just rest quietly.</font>

53
00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go.</font>

54
00:03:20,510 --> 00:03:23,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay out of my way. Gosunkugi is mine.</font>

55
00:03:23,850 --> 00:03:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck can you do
in that condition, you wanted man?</font>

56
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bounty hunter who was in the bar
attacked last night.</font>

57
00:03:39,190 --> 00:03:42,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the idea of a bounty
chasing after a bounty?</font>

58
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's none of your concern.</font>

59
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:51,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your wound again.</font>

60
00:03:53,790 --> 00:03:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

61
00:03:56,590 --> 00:03:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move.</font>

62
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't do it.</font>

63
00:04:03,430 --> 00:04:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, how do you explain
this wanted flyer?</font>

64
00:04:08,970 --> 00:04:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Gosunkugi did it.</font>

65
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:15,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He killed an innocent family of three...</font>

66
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just to steal money.</font>

67
00:04:20,150 --> 00:04:22,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by that?</font>

68
00:04:28,490 --> 00:04:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was a swordsmith in a tiny village</font>

69
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in a small country
sandwiched between two large countries.</font>

70
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was poor,
but for me it was a happy life.</font>

71
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But on that festival day...</font>

72
00:05:20,290 --> 00:05:24,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was about to go deliver a sword
that a customer had ordered.</font>

73
00:05:27,550 --> 00:05:30,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to participate in the festival,
so I was hurrying.</font>

74
00:05:30,930 --> 00:05:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that very moment...</font>

75
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For some reason,
the door was half open.</font>

76
00:05:44,150 --> 00:05:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Tokichi.
I'm delivering the sword you ordered.</font>

77
00:06:56,350 --> 00:06:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told everyone everything as it happened.</font>

78
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:04,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the people in the village
wouldn't believe me.</font>

79
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because I was the only one
who hadn't shown up at the festival.</font>

80
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:14,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the particular shape of the sword
that stabbed through the family.</font>

81
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:18,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A swordsmith should be able to make
any kind of weapon.</font>

82
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was the reason.</font>

83
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:23,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand up, Tokichi!</font>

84
00:07:24,460 --> 00:07:26,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tokichi! Don't let him get away!
After him!</font>

85
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And ever since...</font>

86
00:07:33,010 --> 00:07:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've wandered aimlessly
from town to town.</font>

87
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:42,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"ONE MILLION RYO"</b></font>

88
00:07:44,690 --> 00:07:46,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was something the villagers had issued.</font>

89
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:51,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there was one more
wanted flyer beside mine...</font>

90
00:07:54,660 --> 00:07:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the man who killed the family.</font>

91
00:08:03,620 --> 00:08:08,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I resolved to capture Gosunkugi
with my own hands.</font>

92
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would clear my name
and return to my village,</font>

93
00:08:27,610 --> 00:08:30,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And to get some information about him,
if even just a little...</font>

94
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I became a bounty hunter
despite having a price on my own head.</font>

95
00:08:53,420 --> 00:08:56,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that's why we were in the way, huh?</font>

96
00:08:57,050 --> 00:09:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only way to prove my innocence
is for me to capture him myself.</font>

97
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to go home.</font>

98
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:10,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will you concede him to me?</font>

99
00:09:16,070 --> 00:09:20,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're Ninja. We carry out missions
we've received, no matter what!</font>

100
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if the worst were to happen,
we can't let him get away.</font>

101
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

102
00:09:44,350 --> 00:09:46,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was that okay, Naruto?</font>

103
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Gosunkugi jerk!</font>

104
00:09:50,900 --> 00:09:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to capture him, no matter what.</font>

105
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

106
00:09:57,030 --> 00:10:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if that old man, Sazanami,
pushes it too far in his condition,</font>

107
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:04,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not only will he fail
in capturing Gosunkugi,</font>

108
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he could end up getting killed instead.</font>

109
00:10:23,810 --> 00:10:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't hold back. I'll give you...</font>

110
00:10:28,310 --> 00:10:29,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the likes of my head.</font>

111
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wounded,
so I can kill you whenever I want.</font>

112
00:10:36,530 --> 00:10:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before that, I'll be taking Gosunkugi.</font>

113
00:10:40,570 --> 00:10:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess I'll just have
those Shinobi kids do their best.</font>

114
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Stone, Post Station 2.</font>

115
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:01,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems everything in this town,</font>

116
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:05,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">politics, economics, military,
is conducted by monks.</font>

117
00:11:06,930 --> 00:11:09,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It really is. Nothing but temples.</font>

118
00:11:11,810 --> 00:11:14,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The temple,
which could be called the head temple,</font>

119
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the OK Temple on that mountain.</font>

120
00:11:17,190 --> 00:11:19,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hinata. What's that bell?</font>

121
00:11:19,990 --> 00:11:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was created as
the sightseeing crown jewel</font>

122
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to recruit people to live in their temple.</font>

123
00:11:24,530 --> 00:11:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Golden Bell!</font>

124
00:11:27,490 --> 00:11:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just like it is saying,
"Please steal me."</font>

125
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know. Gosunkugi is after that bell!</font>

126
00:11:36,630 --> 00:11:37,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yeah.
— Yeah.</font>

127
00:12:09,450 --> 00:12:13,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how does that Gosunkugi guy
intend to steal that bell?</font>

128
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:28,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

129
00:12:42,110 --> 00:12:44,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are Gosunkugi's!</font>

130
00:12:45,530 --> 00:12:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are these guys going to corral us?</font>

131
00:12:48,330 --> 00:12:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like the time with Sazanami.</font>

132
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan.</font>

133
00:12:56,580 --> 00:12:57,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look out! Run!</font>

134
00:13:01,630 --> 00:13:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old Man Sazanami?</font>

135
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:04,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave this to me.</font>

136
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

137
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this!</font>

138
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:21,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing here?</font>

139
00:13:22,230 --> 00:13:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just came to settle the score.</font>

140
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:26,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But your wound is still...</font>

141
00:13:27,110 --> 00:13:29,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't get in your way.</font>

142
00:13:29,620 --> 00:13:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll pursue the target on my own.
This is a competition.</font>

143
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:36,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess it can't be helped. I accept.</font>

144
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:40,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we can't even start
as things stand now.</font>

145
00:13:41,210 --> 00:13:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are still nails in the ground.</font>

146
00:13:44,590 --> 00:13:46,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's waiting for the best moment.</font>

147
00:13:47,090 --> 00:13:48,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosunkugi!</font>

148
00:13:53,850 --> 00:13:55,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bell is at the top!</font>

149
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Could it be?</font>

150
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

151
00:14:02,690 --> 00:14:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The nails in the ground aren't moving.</font>

152
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:06,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— The Jutsu has worn off!
— What?</font>

153
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! When did he...?</font>

154
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:12,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, as the words say,
we've been "nailed down," huh?</font>

155
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:22,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're by the bell!</font>

156
00:14:22,460 --> 00:14:24,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Why that...
— Wait.</font>

157
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:29,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget the bounty hunter
from last night is also after Gosunkugi!</font>

158
00:14:30,890 --> 00:14:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem.
We'll get there first, no matter what.</font>

159
00:14:35,770 --> 00:14:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

160
00:14:55,290 --> 00:14:58,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— How awful.
— That Gosunkugi jerk!</font>

161
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unforgivable!</font>

162
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:04,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Where's Gosunkugi?</font>

163
00:15:04,250 --> 00:15:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! He'll get away if we're too slow!</font>

164
00:15:08,090 --> 00:15:11,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't have any time to think.
Let's take care of this in one shot!</font>

165
00:15:14,050 --> 00:15:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist!</font>

166
00:15:18,890 --> 00:15:19,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru!</font>

167
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:23,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art of Beast Mimicry.</font>

168
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:28,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man-Beast Clone!</font>

169
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over Fang!</font>

170
00:15:31,490 --> 00:15:32,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

171
00:15:36,290 --> 00:15:38,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki!</font>

172
00:15:38,830 --> 00:15:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto Barrage!</font>

173
00:15:41,250 --> 00:15:41,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go.</font>

174
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hit you with the back of the sword.</font>

175
00:15:57,220 --> 00:15:59,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Gosunkugi?</font>

176
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:03,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That way!</font>

177
00:16:15,870 --> 00:16:18,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Gosunkugi.
— He's ours!</font>

178
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man, you're going to prove
your innocence, right?</font>

179
00:16:28,170 --> 00:16:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're a bounty hunter,
then show your pride!</font>

180
00:16:37,470 --> 00:16:39,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Flying Nail Mist.</font>

181
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

182
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this!</font>

183
00:16:53,610 --> 00:16:54,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too slow!</font>

184
00:17:08,210 --> 00:17:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Farewell.</font>

185
00:17:12,050 --> 00:17:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

186
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not over yet!</font>

187
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:21,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— Prepare yourself!</font>

188
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

189
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:26,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be hasty.</font>

190
00:17:35,450 --> 00:17:40,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I kill you, the one who can prove
my innocence will be gone.</font>

191
00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:43,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We lose.</font>

192
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:45,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

193
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:49,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

194
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:53,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bounty Sazanami,
otherwise known as Tokichi...</font>

195
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:56,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, Gatsu, have apprehended you!</font>

196
00:17:57,550 --> 00:18:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you, bounty Gosunkugi!</font>

197
00:18:01,050 --> 00:18:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your spree of evil deeds...</font>

198
00:18:03,350 --> 00:18:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The number of charges against you
is incalculable.</font>

199
00:18:06,180 --> 00:18:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A government official has ordered
you hauled in for questioning.</font>

200
00:18:12,230 --> 00:18:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man...</font>

201
00:18:14,230 --> 00:18:17,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. There's nothing we can do
if the opposition is a bureaucrat.</font>

202
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:27,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You murderer!</font>

203
00:18:27,790 --> 00:18:29,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give back the family you killed!</font>

204
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll kill you in the same way!</font>

205
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

206
00:18:47,430 --> 00:18:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, you guys! You've got
some nerve putting up wanted flyers</font>

207
00:18:50,900 --> 00:18:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without a thorough investigation!</font>

208
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:07,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This man is the true culprit behind
the murder that occurred in this village!</font>

209
00:19:07,450 --> 00:19:08,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">WANTED REWARD THREE MILLION RYO</font>

210
00:19:13,710 --> 00:19:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosunkugi has already been apprehended
and has confessed.</font>

211
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the weapon has been seized.</font>

212
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, this individual, Tokichi,
shall be acquitted!</font>

213
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerks!</font>

214
00:19:26,390 --> 00:19:30,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You made me work for free!
What are you going to do about it?</font>

215
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why'd you do that for me?</font>

216
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I overheard some stupid tale of woe,
you see.</font>

217
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It makes no difference
to a bounty hunter...</font>

218
00:19:47,330 --> 00:19:49,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I overheard it,
and so I had no choice.</font>

219
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was necessary to verify whether or not
you really are a wanted man.</font>

220
00:19:56,210 --> 00:19:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You.</font>

221
00:19:57,090 --> 00:19:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not "you" Gatsu.</font>

222
00:20:00,590 --> 00:20:04,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm also a bounty hunter.
I'm in the same trade as you.</font>

223
00:20:08,010 --> 00:20:08,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gatsu</font>

224
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tokichi, we're sorry.</font>

225
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:13,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive us, Tokichi.</font>

226
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good for you, old man Sazanami.</font>

227
00:20:17,730 --> 00:20:18,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

228
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:34,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've kind of gotten homesick
and really miss the Leaf Village.</font>

229
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:38,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, you know,
a failed mission means failure.</font>

230
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage's going
to scold you good, Naruto.</font>

231
00:20:44,430 --> 00:20:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

232
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You failed another mission?!</font>

233
00:20:48,970 --> 00:20:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... don't want to go home.</font>

234
00:21:18,980 --> 00:21:30,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

235
00:21:18,980 --> 00:21:30,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

236
00:21:30,630 --> 00:21:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

237
00:21:30,630 --> 00:21:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

238
00:21:42,230 --> 00:21:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

239
00:21:42,230 --> 00:21:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

240
00:21:53,020 --> 00:22:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

241
00:21:53,020 --> 00:22:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

242
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

243
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

244
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:28,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

245
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:28,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

246
00:22:28,480 --> 00:22:34,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

247
00:22:28,480 --> 00:22:34,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

248
00:22:38,500 --> 00:22:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Creeping up noisily, a round, fat guy and a skinny one!</font>

249
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Beneath the scorching rain, a disastrous tranquility ensues.</font>

250
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Tsunade hits the jackpot!</font>

251
00:22:48,590 --> 00:22:50,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Kakashi's guess is a huge bust!</font>

252
00:22:50,220 --> 00:22:52,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Heard it somewhere, this unprecedented event!</font>

253
00:22:52,260 --> 00:22:54,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">The great acts of Monday and Pocha!</font>

254
00:22:54,220 --> 00:22:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Then comes Naruto...</font>

255
00:22:55,970 --> 00:22:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Let me join in the training too!</font>

256
00:22:58,850 --> 00:23:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Meeting the Rare Visitors. A Great Beast? Wild Beats...? Rare Beast?"</font>

